<!DOCTYPE html>
<!--
  Zymplo · Web v5 "scrollytelling" · rama feat/web-v5-scrollytelling
  Fuente única: /Users/cr/Zymplo-HQ/ZYMPLO-WEB-SPEC.md (seguido al pie).
  Reglas aplicadas: solo features ✅ (§3) · sujeto-activo (§10) · cero vocab prohibido (§10)
    · sin decoración R93-prohibida (nada de spheres/gradient-mesh/radial circles/flag-pills)
    · isotipo R51 (§9) · trilingüe pt/es/en (§11) · wa.me defaults §14.
  PRICING: inline R147 §7 marcado INTERIM. TODO(get_pricing): cablear a src/data/pricing-v5.ts →
    backend zymplo-langgraph/src/tools/tools.py::get_pricing (regla §7 "no hardcodear").
  OMITIDO por honestidad (§4/§CIERRE): "quanto entrou no mês"/resumo (payments.summary 501 🔴),
    cobro Pix automático (501 🔴), badge Google Play (Android 404), social-proof numérico.
  v5.0 = narrativa + coreografía DOM. Upgrade a frames 3D foto-reales = fase render (Blender/Kling).
-->
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Zymplo — a tua secretária dentro do WhatsApp</title>
<meta name="description" content="Manda um áudio e pronto: agenda marcada, lembrete na hora, nota emitida e recibo no WhatsApp do teu cliente. Sem app, sem cadastro." />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Sora:wght@600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style>
  :root{
    --turquesa:#14B8A6; --turquesa-dark:#0F9488; --turquesa-deeper:#0B6B62; --turquesa-light:#5EEAD4; --paler:#CCFBF1;
    --azul:#1E4AD4; --purple:#623AE6; --ink:#0A0B14; --paper:#FAFBFF; --mute:#6B7280; --line:#E7EAF3;
    --dark:#07070D; --success:#22C55E;
    --font-display:'Sora','Manrope',sans-serif; --font-body:'Manrope',sans-serif;
    --ease:cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
  body{font-family:var(--font-body);color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);line-height:1.6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden}
  h1,h2,h3,.display{font-family:var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.02}
  .wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px}
  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
  /* progress */
  #bar{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;height:3px;width:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--turquesa),var(--turquesa-light));z-index:200;transition:width .08s linear}
  /* nav */
  nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:150;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:16px 28px;mix-blend-mode:normal}
  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:var(--ink)}
  .brand svg{width:30px;height:30px;display:block}
  .navr{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
  .langs{display:flex;gap:2px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.7);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:100px;padding:3px;backdrop-filter:blur(8px)}
  .langs button{font:inherit;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--mute);padding:5px 10px;border-radius:100px;cursor:pointer;letter-spacing:.02em}
  .langs button.on{background:var(--ink);color:#fff}
  .cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--turquesa);color:#04201c;font-weight:700;padding:11px 20px;border-radius:100px;font-size:15px;border:0;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .15s var(--ease),background .15s}
  .cta:hover{transform:translateY(-1px) scale(1.02);background:var(--turquesa-light)}
  .cta:active{transform:scale(.97)}
  .cta.big{padding:18px 34px;font-size:19px}
  .cta.ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--ink);border:1.5px solid var(--line)}
  .cta.ghost:hover{background:#fff}
  /* section base */
  section{position:relative;padding:110px 0}
  .eyebrow{display:inline-block;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--turquesa-deeper)}
  .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px);transition:opacity .9s var(--ease),transform .9s var(--ease)}
  .reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
  .d1{transition-delay:.08s}.d2{transition-delay:.16s}.d3{transition-delay:.24s}.d4{transition-delay:.32s}
  /* HERO */
  #hero{min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;padding-top:80px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff 0%,var(--paler) 140%)}
  .herogrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:40px;align-items:center;width:100%}
  #hero h1{font-size:clamp(38px,6vw,74px);font-weight:800}
  #hero .sub{font-size:clamp(17px,1.8vw,21px);color:#3a3f4b;max-width:540px;margin:22px 0 30px}
  .heroctas{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}
  .microclaim{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--mute);margin-top:16px;font-weight:600}
  .heroanim{animation:heroIn 1s var(--ease) both}
  @keyframes heroIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
  /* phone */
  .phone{justify-self:center;width:300px;height:610px;background:#0b0f14;border-radius:44px;padding:12px;box-shadow:0 40px 90px -30px rgba(10,20,40,.5),0 0 0 2px #1c2230;position:relative}
  .screen{background:#0e1621;border-radius:33px;height:100%;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;background-image:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 10%, rgba(20,184,166,.06), transparent 40%)}
  .notch{position:absolute;top:12px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:120px;height:26px;background:#0b0f14;border-radius:0 0 16px 16px;z-index:3}
  .wa-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:16px 14px 12px;background:#0b141b;border-bottom:1px solid #1b2733}
  .wa-av{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--turquesa);display:grid;place-items:center}
  .wa-av svg{width:22px;height:22px}
  .wa-name{color:#eaf2f0;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;font-family:var(--font-display)}
  .wa-on{color:#7ee0cf;font-size:11px}
  .wa-body{flex:1;padding:14px 12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;overflow:hidden;background:#0e1621}
  .msg{max-width:80%;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:14px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.45;opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px);animation:pop .45s var(--ease) forwards}
  .msg.bot{background:#1e2a36;color:#e7eef0;align-self:flex-start;border-bottom-left-radius:5px}
  .msg.me{background:#12775f;color:#eafff8;align-self:flex-end;border-bottom-right-radius:5px}
  .msg .t{display:block;font-size:9.5px;opacity:.6;margin-top:3px;text-align:right}
  .msg.audio{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
  .msg.audio .wv{flex:1;height:16px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,#7ee0cf 0 2px,transparent 2px 5px);opacity:.7;border-radius:3px}
  .msg.doc{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
  .msg.doc .ic{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:7px;background:#eafff8;color:#0b6b62;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:13px;flex:0 0 auto}
  @keyframes pop{to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
  /* STATEMENT (dark wipe) */
  #statement{background:var(--dark);color:var(--paper);text-align:center;padding:150px 0}
  #statement h2{font-size:clamp(34px,6vw,76px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.05}
  #statement .g{color:var(--turquesa-light)}
  /* JORNADA */
  .jgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 300px;gap:50px;align-items:center}
  .jsteps{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}
  .jstep{display:flex;gap:14px;padding:16px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;background:#fff}
  .jstep .h{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;color:var(--turquesa-deeper);font-size:13px;min-width:52px}
  .jstep b{font-family:var(--font-display)}
  /* STEPS */
  .steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:40px}
  .step{padding:28px;border-radius:20px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);position:relative}
  .step .n{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:44px;color:var(--paler);line-height:1;position:absolute;top:16px;right:20px}
  .step h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:8px;position:relative}
  .step p{color:#3a3f4b;font-size:15px}
  /* SUPERPODERES */
  .cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:44px}
  .card{padding:22px;border-radius:18px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);transition:transform .2s var(--ease),box-shadow .2s}
  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 20px 40px -24px rgba(15,148,136,.4)}
  .card .ic{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--paler);color:var(--turquesa-deeper);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:22px;margin-bottom:14px}
  .card h3{font-size:16px;line-height:1.15}
  .card p{font-size:13px;color:var(--mute);margin-top:6px}
  /* APP */
  #app{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff, var(--paler) 180%)}
  .approw{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:40px;align-items:center}
  .badge-ios{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:14px;font-weight:600;margin-top:20px}
  .badge-ios small{display:block;font-size:10px;opacity:.7;font-weight:500}
  /* PERSONAJES */
  .pcards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:40px}
  .pcard{padding:26px;border-radius:20px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line)}
  .pcard .tag{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mute);background:#f1f3f9;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:6px}
  .pcard h3{font-size:19px;margin:14px 0 2px}
  .pcard .role{color:var(--turquesa-deeper);font-weight:700;font-size:13px}
  .pcard .q{font-style:italic;color:#3a3f4b;margin-top:12px;font-size:14px}
  /* PRICING */
  #pricing{background:var(--dark);color:var(--paper)}
  #pricing .eyebrow{color:var(--turquesa-light)}
  .trust{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;margin:22px 0 8px;color:#aeb6c4;font-size:13px}
  .trust span::after{content:'·';margin-left:8px;color:#3a4453}
  .trust span:last-child::after{content:''}
  .plans{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:40px}
  .plan{background:#0f1520;border:1px solid #1e2836;border-radius:20px;padding:26px 22px;position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
  .plan.pro{border-color:var(--turquesa);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--turquesa)}
  .plan .best{position:absolute;top:-11px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:var(--turquesa);color:#04201c;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:100px;white-space:nowrap}
  .plan .pname{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:18px}
  .plan .price{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:34px;margin:10px 0 2px}
  .plan .price small{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#aeb6c4}
  .plan ul{list-style:none;margin:16px 0 22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px}
  .plan li{font-size:13px;color:#cfd6e2;padding-left:22px;position:relative}
  .plan li::before{content:'✓';position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--turquesa-light);font-weight:800}
  .plan .cta{width:100%;justify-content:center;margin-top:auto}
  .plan.free .cta{background:#1e2836;color:#eafff8}
  .pnote{text-align:center;color:#8b95a5;font-size:12px;margin-top:20px}
  /* FAQ */
  .faq{max-width:820px;margin:40px auto 0}
  .qa{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 0}
  .qa button{width:100%;text-align:left;background:0;border:0;font:inherit;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:19px;padding:20px 40px 20px 0;cursor:pointer;position:relative;color:var(--ink)}
  .qa button::after{content:'+';position:absolute;right:6px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);font-size:26px;color:var(--turquesa);transition:transform .2s}
  .qa.open button::after{content:'−'}
  .qa .a{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .3s var(--ease);color:#3a3f4b;font-size:15.5px}
  .qa.open .a{max-height:220px;padding-bottom:20px}
  /* FINAL CTA + FOOTER */
  #final{text-align:center;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--paler),#fff)}
  #final h2{font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,58px);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:28px}
  footer{background:var(--dark);color:#aeb6c4;padding:60px 0 46px;font-size:13.5px}
  footer .fgrid{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-start}
  footer .brand{color:#fff}
  footer a{color:#cfd6e2}
  footer .ent{max-width:520px;line-height:1.9}
  footer .legal{margin-top:26px;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid #1a2230;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#6b7688}
  /* sticky cta */
  #stickycta{position:fixed;right:20px;bottom:20px;z-index:140;box-shadow:0 16px 40px -12px rgba(15,148,136,.6)}
  @media(max-width:900px){
    .herogrid,.jgrid,.approw{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .phone{order:-1}
    .steps,.cards,.plans,.pcards{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
    .navr .cta{display:none}
  }
  @media(max-width:560px){.cards,.plans,.pcards,.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.reveal,.heroanim,.msg{transition:none!important;animation:none!important;opacity:1!important;transform:none!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="bar"></div>

<nav>
  <a class="brand" href="#hero" aria-label="Zymplo">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 96 96"><g fill="none" stroke="#14B8A6" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M26 44 L40 28 L54 44 L72 22"/><path d="M22 56 Q48 86 74 56"/></g></svg>
    <span>zymplo</span>
  </a>
  <div class="navr">
    <div class="langs" id="langs">
      <button data-lang="pt" class="on">PT</button>
      <button data-lang="es">ES</button>
      <button data-lang="en">EN</button>
    </div>
    <a class="cta wa" href="#" data-i18n="nav_cta">Começar grátis</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section id="hero">
  <div class="wrap herogrid">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow heroanim" data-i18n="hero_eyebrow">AO VIVO · PERTO DE VOCÊ</span>
      <h1 class="heroanim" data-i18n="hero_h1" style="animation-delay:.05s">Gente como você ganhando perto de você</h1>
      <p class="sub heroanim" data-i18n="hero_sub" style="animation-delay:.12s">Manda um áudio e pronto: agenda marcada, lembrete na hora certa, nota emitida e recibo no WhatsApp do teu cliente.</p>
      <div class="heroctas heroanim" style="animation-delay:.18s">
        <a class="cta wa" href="#" data-i18n="hero_cta">Começar grátis</a>
        <a class="cta ghost" href="#como" data-i18n="hero_cta2">Ver como funciona</a>
      </div>
      <div class="microclaim heroanim" data-i18n="hero_micro" style="animation-delay:.24s">Sem app · nem cadastro</div>
    </div>
    <div class="phone heroanim" style="animation-delay:.1s">
      <div class="notch"></div>
      <div class="screen">
        <div class="wa-top">
          <div class="wa-av"><svg viewBox="0 0 96 96"><g fill="none" stroke="#04201c" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M26 44 L40 28 L54 44 L72 22"/><path d="M22 56 Q48 86 74 56"/></g></svg></div>
          <div><div class="wa-name">Zymplo</div><div class="wa-on" data-i18n="wa_online">online</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="wa-body" id="chat"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- STATEMENT -->
<section id="statement">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="reveal"><span data-i18n="st1">Menos estresse.</span> <span class="g" data-i18n="st2">Mais controle.</span> <span data-i18n="st3">Mais dinheiro.</span></h2>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- JORNADA -->
<section id="jornada">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow reveal" data-i18n="j_eyebrow">UM DIA COM O ZYMPLO</span>
    <h2 class="reveal d1" style="font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);margin:10px 0 34px;max-width:720px" data-i18n="j_title">Do primeiro “oi” até a nota emitida — sem sair da conversa.</h2>
    <div class="jgrid">
      <div class="jsteps">
        <div class="jstep reveal d1"><span class="h">06:31</span><div data-i18n="j1"><b>Bom dia.</b> O Zymplo já te mostra a agenda do dia.</div></div>
        <div class="jstep reveal d2"><span class="h">08:50</span><div data-i18n="j2"><b>Serviço feito.</b> Você manda um áudio e ele entende.</div></div>
        <div class="jstep reveal d2"><span class="h">08:51</span><div data-i18n="j3"><b>Nota + recibo.</b> Emite a NFS-e e manda o recibo em PDF pro cliente.</div></div>
        <div class="jstep reveal d3"><span class="h">14:18</span><div data-i18n="j4"><b>Próximo cliente.</b> Agenda a visita e lembra vocês dois.</div></div>
        <div class="jstep reveal d3"><span class="h">21:38</span><div data-i18n="j5"><b>Fim do dia.</b> Compartilha tua página pra atrair mais serviço.</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="phone reveal d2" style="transform:scale(.92)">
        <div class="notch"></div>
        <div class="screen">
          <div class="wa-top">
            <div class="wa-av"><svg viewBox="0 0 96 96"><g fill="none" stroke="#04201c" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M26 44 L40 28 L54 44 L72 22"/><path d="M22 56 Q48 86 74 56"/></g></svg></div>
            <div><div class="wa-name">Zymplo</div><div class="wa-on" data-i18n="wa_online">online</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="wa-body" id="chat2"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- COMO FUNCIONA -->
<section id="como">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow reveal" data-i18n="c_eyebrow">SIMPLES ASSIM</span>
    <h2 class="reveal d1" style="font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,46px);margin-top:10px" data-i18n="c_title">Três passos. Menos de 30 segundos.</h2>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step reveal d1"><span class="n">1</span><h3 data-i18n="c1t">Salva o número e manda “oi”.</h3><p data-i18n="c1p">Sem baixar app, sem cadastro, sem formulário.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal d2"><span class="n">2</span><h3 data-i18n="c2t">Fala do teu jeito.</h3><p data-i18n="c2p">Por texto ou áudio. O Zymplo entende como um amigo.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal d3"><span class="n">3</span><h3 data-i18n="c3t">O Zymplo fecha.</h3><p data-i18n="c3p">Agenda, lembrete, nota fiscal e recibo — feito.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SUPERPODERES -->
<section id="super">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow reveal" data-i18n="s_eyebrow">O QUE O ZYMPLO FAZ POR VOCÊ</span>
    <h2 class="reveal d1" style="font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,46px);margin-top:10px" data-i18n="s_title">Os superpoderes</h2>
    <div class="cards" id="cards"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- APP -->
<section id="app">
  <div class="wrap approw">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow reveal" data-i18n="a_eyebrow">O WHATSAPP É O PRINCIPAL</span>
      <h2 class="reveal d1" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.6vw,42px);margin:10px 0 16px" data-i18n="a_title">Quer ver tudo numa tela? Tem app também.</h2>
      <p class="reveal d2" style="color:#3a3f4b;max-width:460px" data-i18n="a_sub">Entra com o teu WhatsApp, sem senha. Vê teu negócio e emite tua nota de qualquer lugar.</p>
      <div class="badge-ios reveal d2"><span style="font-size:24px"></span><span><small data-i18n="a_badge_s">Baixe na</small><span data-i18n="a_badge">App Store</span></span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal d2" style="justify-self:center">
      <div class="phone" style="transform:scale(.88)">
        <div class="notch"></div>
        <div class="screen" style="background:#0e1621;color:#e7eef0;padding:22px 16px">
          <div style="text-align:center;color:var(--turquesa-light);font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:18px;margin-top:14px">zymplo</div>
          <div style="margin-top:20px;font-size:12px;color:#9fb0ab" data-i18n="a_scr1">📊 Meu negócio</div>
